        <description><![CDATA[<h1>Project Team Provisioning / Onboarding</h1>
<hr />
<h2>Welcome</h2>
<p>Provision all essential tools, access, and collaboration resources required for a new project team through a single, standardized request. This Order Guide simplifies project onboarding by combining multiple service requests into one submission, ensuring faster delivery and consistent governance.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Services Included</h2>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;"><li>Project SharePoint Site – Create a dedicated SharePoint site for project documentation and collaboration.</li><li>Jira / Azure DevOps Access – Request project access with the appropriate role for team members.</li><li>Cloud Environment Access – Provision access to AWS, Azure, or GCP environments.</li><li>Database Access – Request secure read/write access to project databases.</li><li>Collaboration Channels – Create Microsoft Teams or Slack channels and add project members.</li><li>Security &amp; Compliance Approvals – Initiate required security reviews and approval workflows.</li></ul>
<hr />
<h2>What You&#39;ll Need</h2>
<p>Before submitting your request, please have the following information available:</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;"><li>Project Name</li><li>Project Code / ID</li><li>Project Manager</li><li>Business Unit</li><li>Environment (Development, Test, UAT, Production)</li><li>Team Members (if applicable)</li><li>Project Start Date</li><li>Project End Date</li><li>Business Justification</li></ul>
<hr />
<h2>Benefits</h2>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;"><li>Accelerates project kickoff and team onboarding</li><li>Standardizes project provisioning across the organization</li><li>Captures all required approvals in a single workflow</li><li>Reduces manual effort and duplicate requests</li><li>Improves governance, compliance, and audit readiness</li><li>Provides end-to-end visibility of provisioning status</li></ul>
<hr />
<h2>Process Overview</h2>
<p>Submit Order Guide → Required Approvals → Resource Provisioning → Notifications → Project Team Ready</p>
<hr />
<h3>Thank You</h3>
<p>Thank you for using the Project Team Provisioning / Onboarding Order Guide. Our automated workflows will route your request to the appropriate teams and keep you informed throughout the provisioning process.</p>]]></description>
